#: includes/class-settings-tab.php:134
msgid "The Consent Blocking Engine is blocking with its default settings, but its settings screen needs the Baukasten - Privacy Toolkit plugin. Install it to categorise the assets this site loads."
msgstr "Die Consent Blocking Engine blockiert mit ihren Standardeinstellungen, aber die Einstellungsseite braucht das Plugin Baukasten - Privacy Toolkit. Installiere es, um die Dateien dieser Website zu kategorisieren."

#: includes/class-settings-tab.php:203
